      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Real-time; weekly review
Frequency: Continuous; weekly deep review
Volume: 200 stores; ~400–800 active tasks/month
Owner: VP Store Operations
Participants: VP Store Operations, COO
Source: workflow W2368 — Task Compliance Dashboard</bpmn:documentation>
