        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-199 (ensure store-communication task closure.) | - Operational: VP Store Operations daily/weekly review; COO escalation on chronic non-compliance
Owner: VP Store Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
