    <bpmn:process id="W_W2369" name="W2369. Regional Operations Follow-Up" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store has overdue or non-compliant tasks
Frequency: Daily; ~20–30 overdue tasks/week
Volume: ~20–30 overdue follow-ups/week
Owner: Regional Operations Manager
Participants: Regional Ops Manager, VP Store Operations
Source: workflow W2369 — Regional Operations Follow-Up</bpmn:documentation>
