Responsible (R): Regional Ops Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2371_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2371_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
